{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "It was, yes.\nBut not anymore.": "",
  "It was, yes... but no longer.": "",
  "Heh, that so?": "",
  "That's funny. Because I spent my\nentire life chasing that dream for you!": "",
  "Funny. 'Cause I... I've spent my whole life\nchasing that dream.": "",
  "The goal you fucking told me\nto strive for! ": "",
  "The goal you fucking told me\nto strive for!": "",
  "Let's get back on topic, shall we!?": "",
  "Stick to the answers I ask for!": "",
  "Tell me this. You started shopping the Mole's\nservices around. What then? What happened?": "",
  "Let's pull it back. So you started shopping\nthe Mole's services around... So? What then?": "",
  "Wasn't long 'til we got our first hit.": "",
  "...Wasn't long 'til we got our first hit.": "",
  "Our mark was Hashiki.\nVice director of the ADDC.": "",
  "The vice director of the ADDC.\nSomeone wanted him dead.": "",
  "And Shono's the one who hired you?": "",
  "That someone being... Shono, right?": "",
  "So I heard. He always contacted me\nthrough someone else.": "",
  "Probably. Though I hadn't met the man myself.\nHe did his work through a contact.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I see. So there was a middleman that connected\nthe Kamurocho yakuza to the ADDC.)</color>": "",
  "Someone else? Who?": "",
  "Guy by the name of Ishimatsu.": "",
  "Strange guy. Went by Ishimatsu.": "",
  "Short little guy. Always had this creepy\nfuckin' smile on his face.": "",
  "He was short, and always wearing\nthis creepy fuckin' smile.": "",
  "At the time, we all thought this was gonna be\na one-off.\nDidn't do much prying, y'know.": "",
  "At the time, we all thought this was gonna be a one-off.\nDidn't do much prying, y'know?": "",
  "Never even knew why they wanted the guy dead.\nWe just took the 10 mil and did what we were asked.": "",
  "Never even knew why they wanted Hashiki dead.\nJust took the ten mil and did our job.": "",
  "They wanted him to die\ndiscreetly, though... right?": "",
  "They wanted him to die discreetly,\nthough, right?": "",
  "Pretty much... so he did.\nIshimatsu took a real shine to us after that.": "",
  "Few months later,\nhe was back with another job.": "",
  "Few months later, he was back\nwith another job for us.": "",
  "And that was?": "",
  "Another job?": "",
  "Well... Gathering test subjects for their AD-9\nexperiments. And disposing of the bodies.": "",
  "Yeah... Gathering test subjects for AD-9 experiments.\nAnd disposing of the bodies.": "",
  "Ichinose...": "",
  "Ichinose.": "",
  "So the Ministry of Health is in on this,\ntoo... It goes all the way up...": "",
  "The guy from the Ministry of Health?\nThey're in on this too?": "",
  "Maybe it does.\nYou familiar with the Medical Institute?": "",
  "Seems like it. How about the Medical Institute?\nYou familiar?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The Medical Institute... That's the organization\nthat runs the ADDC.)</color>": "",
  "It's home to the ADDC, and it makes a comfy place\nfor all the Health Ministry execs to go retire.": "",
  "It's home to the ADDC, and its where\nHealth Ministry execs go to retire.": "",
  "Well, it just so happens that the guy who founded\nit twenty years ago... was none other than Ichinose.": "",
  "Well, just so happens that the guy who founded\nit twenty years ago... was none other than Ichinose.": "",
  "He rode that success\nall the way up to vice minister.": "",
  "Then he rode that success\nall the way up to vice minister.": "",
  "In other words, his whole legacy's\nriding on the ADDC.": "",
  "AD-9's gotta come out on top\nfor him to stay on top.": "",
  "And if he wants to stay on top,\nAD-9's gotta be a winner.": "",
  "And he's willing to murder\nto make sure that happens?": "",
  "And to ensure that...\nhe'd stoop to murder?": "",
  "Ichinose's not the only\none profiting, either.": "",
  "AD-9's got a lot of backers...": "",
  "There are tons of parties involved.\nAll being promised this much cash or that favor.": "",
  "Ichinose's not the only one profiting.\nOthers are being promised big cash, favors...": "",
  "If people have to die for AD-9\nto succeed... so be it.": "",
  "Doesn't matter how many have to die.\nThey can't afford to fail now.": "",
  "This shit got real serious\nreal quick, didn't it?": "",
  "This is turnin' into some\nserious shit, huh?": "",
  "We in over our heads?": "",
  "You sure we'll be okay here?": "",
  "In the end, maybe it was my own incompetence\nthat led Hamura down this path...": "",
  "In the end, maybe this is all my fault.\nMy incompetence led Hamura down this path...": "",
  "Here's a question. Why'd you go after\nKyorei guys for the experiments?": "",
  "Here's a question.\nWhy'd you go after Kyorei guys for the experiments?": "",
  "Just following Shono's orders.": "",
  "...Shono told you to?": "",
  "...Shono asked for them?": "",
  "Yup. He said there was a chance of the subject\ndyin' when we gave 'em the AD-9.": "",
  "Yup. AD-9 was potentially lethal as it was,\naccording to him.": "",
  "Now if regular old civilians started disappearing,\nthat'd make the news in no time.": "",
  "But nobody'd notice a few missing\nyakuza during a turf war.": "",
  "But... nobody'd notice a few missing yakuza\nduring a turf war.": "",
  "Only natural there'd be\nsome casualties, yeah?": "",
  "After all, only natural there'd be\nsome casualties.": "",
  "I guess so.": "",
  "...I guess.": "",
  "That wasn't the only reason, though.": "",
  "He had one more reason.": "",
  "Shono said he didn't wanna perform\ndangerous experiments on innocent civilians.": "",
  "See, Shono... He didn't wanna perform\ndangerous experiments on innocent civilians.": "",
  "And what, these yakuza\ndeserved this somehow?": "",
  "So because they're yakuza,\nthey're disposable?": "",
  "The Kajihira Group was the one trying\nto shut down the ADDC to begin with.": "",
  "The Kajihira Group was the one trying to\nshut down the ADDC to begin with.": "",
  "And the Kyorei were Kajihira's lapdogs.": "",
  "Plus, he figured the Kyorei were\njust his lapdogs.": "",
  "A couple of dead thugs\ndidn't weigh on him too much.": "",
  "So a couple dead thugs?\nIt didn't weigh on him too much.": "",
  "But don't shoot the messenger.\nShono's the one who said it.": "",
  "Don't shoot the messenger here.\nShono's the one who said it.": "",
  "You'll keep talking if you know what's good for you.\nUnless you wanna go back to the hard way. I'm all for it.": "",
  "Just keep talkin' for us, buddy.\nOnce you're done, I can get to the fun part.": "",
  "What else could you\npossibly wanna know?": "",
  "Tsk... Haven't I told you\neverything already?": "",
  "Actually, I've got one more thing.": "",
  "Nope. I've got something.": "",
  "You made it sound earlier like you weren't that involved\nin the killings. But that's not the whole truth, is it?": "",
  "When I asked, it sounded like you weren't that involved\nin the Mole's killings. But that's not the whole truth, is it?": "",
  "In fact, I have something that shows you actively\nhelped carry out the Kyorei killings.": "",
  "In fact, I have proof that shows you\nactively helped carry out the Kyorei killings. Here...": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The proof that Hamura took part in\nattacking the Kyorei Clan is...)</color>": "",
  "The security camera behind Amour, where the third\nvictim, Toshiro Kume, was abducted.": "",
  "When the third victim, Toshiro Kume, was abducted,\nthere was a security camera behind Amour.": "",
  "It was broken at the time of the murder.": "",
  "At the time of the murder,\nit was broken.": "",
  "Yeah? What about it?": "",
  "Hm? Actually, hold on a sec.": "",
  "That's not what I wanted to show you.": "",
  "The hell are you doing, Yagami?": "",
  "Hey. The hell are ya\ndoing, Yagami?": "",
  "Now then. I have something that shows you\nactively helped carry out the Kyorei killings.": "",
  "Anyway. I have something that shows you\nactively helped carry out the Kyorei killings. Here...": "",
  "The autopsy report for\nthe third victim, Toshiro Kume.": "",
  "The autopsy report for the\nthird victim, Toshiro Kume.": "",
  "It says the cause of death was an ice-pick-shaped\ninstrument piercing his brain through the eye socket. ": "",
  "It says the cause of death was an ice-pick-shaped\ninstrument, piercing his brain through the eye socket. ": "",
  "Yup. But that was the Mole.\nI didn't have anything to do with it.": "",
  "Yup. But that was the Mole.\nNothing to do with me.": "",
  "...Right, I guess not.": "",
  "The autopsy report for\nthe first victim, Kenkichi Mashiba.": "",
  "The autopsy report for the\nfirst victim, Kenkichi Mashiba.": "",
  "Huh? My guy handled that one.\nI don't know shit about it.": "",
  "Huh? My guy handled that one.\nI don't know shit about it. That's the Mole's work.": "",
  "The autopsy report for\nthe second victim, Yasuo Kunimura.": "",
  "The autopsy report for the\nsecond victim, Yasuo Kunimura.": "",
  "It was all fun and games for him at Konban Wife,\nuntil someone gouged his eyes out a few hours later.": "",
  "Sucks for the guy, sure. But that was the Mole.\nI didn't lift a damn finger.": "",
  "Sucks for the guy, sure. But I didn't lift a damn finger.\nAll that stuff you just said? That was the Mole.": "",
  "Check this out. Look familiar?\nIt's camera footage of you abducting Kume.": "",
  "That shot look familiar?\nIt's camera footage of you abducting Kume.": "",
  "So tell me. Why'd you take the fall?\nThey even got your face on tape.": "",
  "I've been wondering why you'd take the fall.\nThey even got your face on tape.": "",
  "You're not usually that sloppy.": "",
  "You're not that sloppy.": "",
  "Answer me.": "",
  "Let's hear it.": "",
  "That was right after we axed\ntwo Kyorei guys one after another.": "",
  "At the time, we'd just axed two Kyorei guys.\nKilling two in a row made 'em wise.": "",
  "They started catching on.\nWouldn't go 'round town alone anymore.": "",
  "After that... they started catching on.\nWouldn't go 'round town alone anymore.": "",
  "Keep going.": "",
  "When your mark's that on guard, nobody's\nlaying a hand on 'em. Not even a trained assassin.": "",
  "They were on guard. Even the Mole couldn't do much\nwith them lookin' around every corner.": "",
  "So, the Mole needed a hand.\nSomeone he could trust to get the ball rolling.": "",
  "So, the Mole needed a little push.\nSomeone to get things rolling.": "",
  "And that someone, was me.": "",
  "I guess... that someone was me.": "",
  "But helping him is what got you\narrested for Kume's murder.": "",
  "Was that part of the plan?\nWere you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>supposed</font_kind> to get caught?": "",
  "They'd have put you away for life.": "",
  "That's why I needed an alibi.": "",
  "Had to be somewhere lots of people would see me.": "",
  "Sauna Goten.": "",
  "Mhm. But it turned out, there weren't as many witnesses as I was hopin'. Security footage was fuzzy as shit, too.": "",
  "So of course my alibi got tossed.": "",
  "Prosecutors didn't care if I actually did it. They'd make a story up if it meant resolving the case.": "",
  "For yakuza on yakuza violence? Didn't matter whose head rolled so long as someone's did.": "",
  "So you didn't want to get arrested. Guess not everything went according to plan.": "",
  "So, what happened after\nyou left Amour?": "",
  "So, what happened after you\nleft Amour?": "",
  "My guy took Kume out the back.": "",
  "Loaded him in the trunk of a car. Took him\nto Shono. Just like all the other AD-9 tests.": "",
  "Just like all the other AD-9 guinea pigs... we threw him\nin the trunk of a car, then took him to Shono.": "",
  "To the ADDC?": "",
  "Nah, not the Center.": "",
  "I'm not sure where it is exactly.\nSome place Shono and the Mole set up.": "",
  "Don't know exactly. Some hidden drop-off.\nThe Mole knew where to go.": "",
  "So they carried out their human experiments\nin some kinda... secret lab?": "",
  "So the human experiments... All those went down\nin some kinda secret lab?": "",
  "Suppose they did.": "",
  "Well then why'd they need\nto gouge the eyes out?": "",
  "Then... why the need to\ngouge the eyes out?": "",
  "No clue.\nHe never told me.": "",
  "No clue. He never told me.": "",
  "Maybe he wanted to make it look like a yakuza killing.\nOr maybe the Mole's just into some sick shit.": "",
  "Maybe the Mole wanted some classic yakuza gore.\n...Or maybe it just turned him on.": "",
  "Okay, so about how the owner of Amour and your men\nleft the club on the night of Kume's murder...": "",
  "On the night Kume was killed, when the Matsugane\nyakuza and the owner of Amour left the club...": "",
  "So how exactly did they murder Kume?": "",
  "I've been turnin' this whole situation over in my head, but I just can't figure it out.": "",
  "Good point. Let's see what we can learn.": "",
  "We have a lot of new info.\nLet's try and figure out what happened to Kume.": "",
  "Guess we're finally seeing the big picture here.": "",
  "Impressive, Tak. You're really something.": "",
  "Lemme rest a bit.\nI'm gonna light up real quick.": "",
  "But in reality it was different?": "",
  "Yeah. The problem is what happened after Hamura and Kume were alone.": "",
  "What happened at Amour during that time?": "",
  "Murase and some other Kyorei yakuza busted in.": "",
  "Wait, hold on.": "",
  "That's not it?": "",
  "Murase did in fact take some guys and go to Amour to rescue Kume.": "",
  "But, Murase said there wasn't anyone there when he went.": "",
  "Then, what happened?": "",
  "Shono's human experiment...?": "",
  "Inside Amour? Is that how it went?": "",
  "No, that's not right.": "",
  "Then what really happened at the club?": "",
  "The Mole appeared.": "",
  "Hamura handed Kume over to him as a test subject for AD-9.": "",
  "Kume got thrown in a trunk and taken to Shono.": "",
  "At 6 AM, his corpse was found in a garbage dump.": "",
  "Guess that means he actually died as a side effect of AD-9.": "",
  "But I still don't know why they gouged the corpse's eyes out. It's still unclear.": "",
  "Next up... is Shintani.": "",
  "Next up... is Shintani's murder.": "",
  "He had nothing to do with the Kyorei Clan,\nbut you guys still used him as an AD-9 test subject.": "",
  "Shintani had nothing to do with the Kyorei,\nbut you guys still used him as a test subject for AD-9.": "",
  "Or was there some other reason\nyou had him killed?": "",
  "Or maybe... was there some other reason\nyou had him killed?": "",
  "Shintani's death...\nThat was my fault.": "",
  "That particular death...\nThat was my fault.": "",
  "What's next on the list?\nKeep the fuckin' pressure on this shithead.": "",
  "What's next on Hamura here?\nKeep the pressure on.": "",
  "When we took care of Kume,\nI was the one on the hook for it.": "",
  "Lemme tell you, endin' up in the slammer\nfor a murder you didn't do is scary shit.": "",
  "Goin' to jail for a hit\nyou didn't do is scary shit.": "",
  "Made me think,\nwouldn't hurt to have some insurance.": "",
  "Made me think... wouldn't hurt\nto have some insurance.": "",
  "Insurance?": "",
  "Insurance...?": "",
  "Talked to Shintani before the trial.\nAnd told him this.": "",
  "Before the trial, I sat down with Shintani.\nTold him this:": "",
  "If the pieces fall into place and I hang for this...\nLook into Shono at the ADDC.": "",
  "\"If the pieces fall into place, and I hang for this...\nlook into Shono at the ADDC.\"": "",
  "So you told him about the deal\nyou made with Ichinose.": "",
  "So he knew everything? You told Shintani\nabout your deal with Ichinose?": "",
  "Not exactly.\nShono was the only name I mentioned.": "",
  "I didn't exactly get into the shit with Ichinose.\nI only mentioned Shono.": "",
  "But if anyone found out I spilled the beans to Shintani,\nwell... I'd be betrayin' the cause.": "",
  "All the same... if anyone found out I told Shintani...\nI'd be marked a snitch.": "",
  "So I told the bastard.\nOnly go digging if shit really hits the fan.": "",
  "That's why I told him, only go digging\nif shit really hits the fan. Otherwise, stay away.": "",
  "Why did he call Shono if he knew it was that important\nto you? Why'd he start digging it up?": "",
  "If he knew it was that big a deal for you...\nthen why did he call Shono directly?": "",
  "Beats me.\nGot a pretty good theory, though.": "",
  "Beats me.\nBut... I've got my own theory.": "",
  "You wanna hear?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Why did Shintani go out of his way\nto call Shono?)</color>": "",
  "Yeah, do tell.": "",
  "Sure. Let's hear it.": "",
  "My guess? He didn't wanna\nlet you hog all the glory.": "",
  "You know Shintani. He didn't wanna let you\nhog all the glory.": "",
  "He might've won my trial,\nbut you're the one who found the key evidence.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Heh, that so?": "ฮึ่ย งั้นเหรอ?",
  "And that was?": "แล้วนั่นคือ...?",
  "I guess so.": "ก็คงงั้นแหละ",
  "Let's hear it.": "ฟังหน่อยสิ",
  "Wait, hold on.": "เดี๋ยว เดี๋ยวสิ",
  "No, that's not right.": "ไม่ใช่ค่ะ ผิดแล้ว"
 }
}
